# LandTrust Kenya – Complete Source Code

Land Records Management System · Node.js + Express + SQLite

## Contents

1. `package.json` – Project configuration and dependencies
2. `server.js` – Starts the server and connects the routes
3. `database/schema.sql` – Database tables: users, land_records, audit_log
4. `database/index.js` – Opens the database, audit helper, demo data
5. `utils/helpers.js` – Password hashing, date formatting, role names
6. `middleware/auth.js` – Sessions and role-based access guard
7. `middleware/upload.js` – Title deed file uploads
8. `routes/auth.routes.js` – Login, logout, session check
9. `routes/records.routes.js` – LAND RECORDS: search, add, duplicate detection, edit, deed upload
10. `routes/admin.routes.js` – Audit trail, user accounts, database viewer
11. `public/index.html` – Page that loads the CSS and scripts
12. `public/css/style.css` – Styling for login and both dashboards
13. `public/js/core.js` – Shared state and the API client
14. `public/js/login.js` – Login page
15. `public/js/app.js` – Sidebar, navigation and Dashboard
16. `public/js/records.js` – LAND RECORDS screens: search, add, upload deed, duplicates, edit
17. `public/js/admin.js` – User accounts, permissions, audit trail, reports, database viewer
18. `public/js/main.js` – Start-up

**Run:** `npm install` then `npm start`, then open http://localhost:3000. Demo logins: `RO-2026-014` / `officer123` (Records Officer), `ADM-002` / `admin123` (Administrator).

